  "img": "icons/svg/blood.svg",
  "description": "<p>Canonical sorted 3d6 wound results. The native 1d216 table weights reproduce all 216 equally likely three-die combinations. For accumulated wounds, use the character’s Roll wound action: roll up to 5d6, keep the highest three and read them in ascending order. That action selects this table’s matching result and applies it.</p>",
